      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agreed, we literally had Microsoft execs admit in a court filing that genAI was theft, that and the affect on the environment and those in the local area should make its use unaccessible, also absolutely true that if genAI content is allowed to run free, people are going to be hesitant to give their money to the platform and its creators. People want things with human intent, not something someone asked a glorified chatbot to conjure from stolen data, be it art or code. \n\nA label is the bare minimum, a ban would help stop the kinds of people who would view this platform the way vultures view carrion, something to pick clean of everything its worth and leave nothing of value behind, be it by their actions or the consequences of letting them run free.",
