      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I want this slop banned entirely from VRC. I'd have been happy compromising with it being labelled so I could avoid it all but VRC's lack of any response to the flood of plagiarised feculence means I want it ripped out of a platform I used to hail as a bastion of creativity.",
